			"width":540,
			"height":200
		},
		{
			"id":"6e60f531176f87d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"from [GitHub](https://github.com/bcakmakoglu/vue-flow/discussions/1388):\n\n```js\nconst { nodesSelectionActive, addSelectedNodes } = useVueFlow()\n\nfunction selectNodes(nodes) {\n\taddSelectedNodes(nodes)\n\tnodesSelectionActive.value = true\n}\n```",
